  m_text: "<b>AFTER-ACTION LEDGER // PROTOCOL ZERO</b>  |  ACTS: 4/4  |  KIA ROSTER: 3/3  |  <color=#49C96E>ENDING A: SCORCHED BLACKOUT BROADCAST</color>\r\n\r\n<b>ACT I \u2014 BLACKWATER PIER (K4-09 DOCK SWEEP)</b>\r\nSmugglers turned out to be AEGIS-contracted scrap crews; Dir. Chen dropped artillery onto Vanguard-09's own dock.\r\n<color=#E05A47>[CASUALTY]: WRAITH-2 (Kozlowski) KIA jamming naval strike lock so gunboat escaped.</color>\r\n\r\n<b>ACT II \u2014 IRON CORRIDOR (AUDIT INCINERATOR CONVOY)</b>\r\nAmbushed Armored Train #774 carrying Karst-4 ash barrels and strike checksums inside Amber Gorge.\r\n<color=#E05A47>[CASUALTY]: SPARK-3 (Reyes) KIA wedging collapsed tunnel bulkheads during thermite blowout.</color>\r\n\r\n<b>ACT III \u2014 KESTREL SUB-STATION (ROE-9 SIGNATURE)</b>\r\nUncovered Rourke's unwilling signature on Karst-4 and Chen's Protocol Zero Halon lockdown.\r\n<color=#E05A47>[CASUALTY]: IRONWOOD-1 (Rourke) KIA holding external lift override inside choking Halon gas.</color>\r\n\r\n<b>ACT IV \u2014 BLACKCREST SUMMIT (SOLE SURVIVOR)</b>\r\nSgt. Vance climbs alone against cleaner unit APEX-01 to either broadcast the truth worldwide or bury the ledger.\r\n<color=#49C96E>[FINAL STATUS]: Peak Stage 0/5 \u2014 Spire Shutdown Complete.</color>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
